  "details": "Would it be possible to connect VRChat to Discord via a bot for three simple reasons:\n\n1 - Improve verification in \"adult\" and \"child\" groups\n\n2 - Optimize role management between VRChat and Discord without having to perform countless steps for a simple action: organizing your group\n\n3 - Alleviate the fragility of the VRChat API, which crashes after three requests\n\nBot already exist but really laggy\n\n- VRIFY : https://buddelbubi.xyz/vrify/\n\n- VGM : https://top.gg/bot/1447927441354920079\n\n- VRCLinking : https://vrclinking.com/",
